						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=434.msg8929#msg8929"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=434.msg8929#msg8929">Re: David Letterman's Top 10 Lamest Duelers</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #48 on:</b> July 01, 2004, 10:55:05 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Theres so many variables in pvp ... pretty dumb to just say XXX class will own XXX.&nbsp; First off pvp and dueling (I&#039;m assuming you mean the arena) are totally different things.<br /><br />&nbsp;A ranger in the arena is at a disadvantage because they cant truly kite you, which is what they do.<br /><br />&nbsp;Sys is correct that in a duel, say in the bazaar arena a time pally vs a time ranger, the pally would <i>probably</i> win.&nbsp; Paladins have weak ass dps but its &gt; ranger healing.&nbsp; Paladin would simply outlast the ranger.&nbsp; Getting in a few hits on each lap around the arena.<br /><br />&nbsp;In pvp, say in an open zone.&nbsp; It may be a different story.&nbsp; The ranger will absolutely own the pally as far as ranged dmg goes, and could theoretically run the pally OOm and make him burn LoH before they even get one hit in.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=333155" target="_blank"><img src="http://members.shaw.ca/jpew/sig.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a></div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9001"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
