								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=434.msg9001#msg9001">Re: David Letterman's Top 10 Lamest Duelers</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #49 on:</b> July 05, 2004, 06:10:03 am &#187;</span></td>
