	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13544"></a><a name="new"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=800" title="View the profile of Ziga Phous">Ziga Phous</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 6<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/hamtaro.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Zigaphous86"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Zigaphous86&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Zigaphous86" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Zigaphous&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Zigaphous" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=800"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Zigaphous@aol.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=434.msg13544#msg13544"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=434.msg13544#msg13544">Re: David Letterman's Top 10 Lamest Duelers</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #50 on:</b> January 06, 2005, 03:31:41 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Dueled a cleric with my mage at the ent of PoEarth (not an arena but if we really felt the need to we could go ahead and run out of the ZI in there and get raped by one of the many wonderful things that make traversing that zone so enjoyable)... forget who the hell it was... someone from Ruination so it wasn&#039;t really important... Busted out his cleric smash hammer fucking proc every hit thing, rooted my pet, didn&#039;t even bother to nuke me just kept me rooted, beyond that my DS was pointless, i ended up with no mana and he was close but even with 2k nukes i was laughed at.... Clerics are the #2 duelist in my book.... Even with stuns they only need to have like 1 second in between them to give themselves another 30 seconds of life... And with self mana regen buffs... ugh.... As for bards yeah you&#039;re right #1.... Only duel i ever by a technicality won against a bard was against Kjunspice... it was in a room in Sanctus Seru so he had this much room to run around in . I forget how it ended... He couldn&#039;t do any damage to me so ended up giving up... I could it as a win and i&#039;m good with it. But yeah.... I couldn&#039;t see myself ever beating a bard.<br /><br />As for the cleric fight.... It may be i was too poorly geared to resist all the roots and such and got raped for it... My unbuffed resists never hit 100... Which was sad as hell even for only an elemental flagged mage.... But because that&#039;s what i had and that was my personal experience....
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Teeter-tottering between brilliance and insanity.<br /><br />Love always - Ziga Phous~
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
